Init — loading the embedded model
. This creates the inference session from an in-memory buffer — deliberately not a file path, for a reason worth calling out explicitly: the Strategy Tester runs each optimization pass in its own agent, and each agent has its own isolated
Files\
folder, separate from the live terminal's. A model loaded by path resolves inconsistently between a live chart and a Tester run. Embedding the model's bytes with
#resource
and loading them with
OnnxCreateFromBuffer
removes the file-path dependency entirely
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//| CNAMEngine::Init                                                 |
//| Creates the ONNX session from an in-memory buffer (a             |
//| #resource-embedded model, per this project's convention of       |
//| avoiding Strategy Tester agent-sandbox file-path issues) and     |
//| fixes the input/output tensor shapes so OnnxRun never has to     |
//| guess them at runtime.                                           |
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
